	(descr "Neutrik etherCON NE8FBH, B-series PCB-mount RJ45 feedthrough. Pad positions taken from Neutrik drawing 20003890 rev D (DXF, 3:1 scale, Y inverted for KiCad). Origin = midpoint of the two 1.55mm latch-post holes, which are symmetric at +/-5.08 / +/-4.445 (drawing dims 10.16 and 8.89). Signal pins 8x 0.8mm on 2.54mm pitch in two rows 2.54mm apart, staggered 1.27mm; SH is the 1.2mm shield/ground pin, +2.16mm from pin 1. Body outline is approximate; PAD GEOMETRY IS EXACT.")
